BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Exit 8
DTSTART:20260415T233000Z
DTEND:20260416T013000Z
DTSTAMP:20260415T233000Z
UID:1hryrQEqBN
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 105 mins (1h45m)\n\nGenki Kawamura’s Dante-inspire
 d spin on Kotake Create’s cult game traps Arashi star Kazunari Ninomiya 
 in a looping\, sterile subway where one mistake resets everything. A purga
 torial thriller born from on-set collaboration\, Exit 8 fuses gameplay log
 ic with razor-sharp\, emotionally charged cinema.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/
 cinema/in-theaters/exit-8\n\nEstimated start: 16:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
